title: We're trapped in time!
pid: cee3faac-642a-456e-93bf-3aede53f2c51
body: |2-
  The world of ideas is a web, not a line. Thinking and communicating in long strings of words is a straitjacket -- one we strangely learn to ignore. To share a knowledge graph is to be free of it, allowing us to share the web of connections in our heads.
